  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "字段级证据跨度。相对 CTR-PK-EVR-001 (Lite) 的增量：引入 sourceVersionId / fragmentId / quoteHash / claimType / applicabilityScope / extractionRunId，使证据可被版本化、可被重放、可被资格校验。Loop L02 候选，未冻结。",
  "examples": [
